Kind: ablation
Issue: #742
Over: 742-widen-dr7-armed-again.patch
Takes out: 979918c1's clearing of DR0-DR3 after #440's window test, so DR0 keeps syscall_entry as it did; over 742-widen-dr7-armed-again the next syscall on the boot processor takes a debug exception on syscall_entry, in ring 0 with the user's stack, as the runner's boot did, and the report names breakpoint 0 from DR6 (9c50c698); the read-back after the test says WRONG as well
Run: --entry 0 600 -smp 1
Expect: dr6 0x[0-9a-f]+: breakpoint 0
